widgets an agent may point at:
  browser (pane) — the project file browser
      can: highlight, pulse, reveal
  tabs (pane) — the row of open document tabs
      can: highlight, pulse, reveal
  editor (source) — the source editor for the active document
      can: highlight, pulse, focus, reveal, annotate
  gutter (source) — the editor's gutter, where section boundaries are marked
      can: highlight, pulse, focus, reveal, annotate
  run_strip (pane) — the run controls and the state of the current run
      can: highlight, pulse, reveal
  output (pane) — the prefix, target and error output panes
      can: highlight, pulse, reveal
  results (pane) — the results pane for the section at the caret
      can: highlight, pulse, reveal
  branches (pane) — the branch selector for the section at the caret
      can: highlight, pulse, reveal
  tables (pane) — the table offers for the latest run
      can: highlight, pulse, reveal
  assistant (pane) — the assistant pane
      can: highlight, pulse, reveal
  name_field (control) — the header field that names new files, folders and branches
      can: highlight, pulse, focus
  run_button (control) — the Run button
      can: highlight, pulse, focus
  save_button (control) — the Save button
      can: highlight, pulse, focus
  new_file_button (control) — the New File button
      can: highlight, pulse, focus
  new_folder_button (control) — the New Folder button
      can: highlight, pulse, focus
  overlay_strip (control) — the overlay acts: edit, save, compare, rebase, promote, discard
      can: highlight, pulse, focus
